+    // Domicile's engine fork: <app>, <webview>, their events, and
+    // canvas.embedExternalSurface().
     //
-    // Stable, so it is on in every configuration of this fork and needs no
-    // command-line flag. That is the whole reason it is stable rather than
-    // statusless: reaching it with --enable-blink-features made Chromium paint
-    // the "You are using an unsupported command-line flag" banner across the
