-    // a test saying it never will. A feature this fork's own desktop cannot
-    // start without belongs on by default.
+    // Stable, because the desktop needs it on every launch, and a statusless
+    // feature is reachable only with --enable-blink-features, which draws a
+    // yellow unsupported-flag bar across the top of the desktop. That bar is
+    // the first thing a user sees and reads as broken, so `spawn::engine`
+    // passes no such flag and has a test saying it never will. A feature this
+    // fork's own desktop cannot start without belongs on by default.
     //
     // It was statusless while the channel was a vertical slice of two members,
     // on the stated condition that it went stable with the other twenty-seven.
